{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226720","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226720","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1422672001:1":{"text":"I can feel it. Your soul and the river... your blood... they're one again.","source_cn":"我感觉到了……河流和你的灵魂……血脉……重新连接在了一起……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D84F9ED3E6C2B77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422672002:0":{"text":"Wherever you go, the aqua leylines of your homeland will follow.","source_cn":"从此……无论你前往何处……故乡的水脉都将与你相连……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE628D112AFDF517A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422672003:1":{"text":"Thank you—ugh!","source_cn":"多谢——呃！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8770756F832C4D69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1422672003":{"text":"Thank you—ugh!","source_cn":"多谢——呃！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8770756F832C4D69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422672004:0":{"text":"I'm fine. Just a bit of residual pain, it's already fading.","source_cn":"还好，只是还有点疼的感觉残留，已经没事了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7904CEAF634660EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422672006:0":{"text":"Now that the river's trial is complete, please tell me what the next one is.","source_cn":"那么，河川的考验已经结束，请告诉我下一项考验是什么吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87CA35404EAA429E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422672007:0":{"text":"You're in bad shape. You really shouldn't move yet.","source_cn":"你现在的身体状况……很、很糟糕。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E2BD455F186A495","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422672008:0":{"text":"It's best not to move. Why don't you rest for a while?","source_cn":"最好不要活动……要休息……否则……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CAC30D5C40E427D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422672009:0":{"text":"Indris, this recklessness serves no one!","source_cn":"因度厄，你这样只是在伤害自己的身体！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BE8AF7C5B794B46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1422672010:0":{"text":"Another trial now? You'd fall to a child's blow in this state!","source_cn":"你现在别说接受考验了，就算普通的战斗恐怕也举步维艰！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28D590D439B4ABD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1422672011:0":{"text":"Thank you. I appreciate your concern, but...","source_cn":"谢谢你们。你们的好意我非常明白，只是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC08D640AF3C9BDAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1422672012:0":{"text":"This pain is nothing compared to the torment of corruption.","source_cn":"只是这份痛苦，对于孽化来说，并不算什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F30048820ACEB19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1422672013:0":{"text":"You're pushing yourself too hard!","source_cn":"你……这样强撑——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x624435297ABC67D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1422672014:0":{"text":"Many in Sal'thorin still suffer under the curse's agony.","source_cn":"萨洛克兰的许多人，此刻仍然在诅咒与孽化交织的苦痛中沉沦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3B8E1E321C19DCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1422672015:0":{"text":"The sooner I act, the more I can save.","source_cn":"如果我能提前一些，那么就会有越多人得到拯救。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE74C88870B3F3575","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1422672016:0":{"text":"Earlier, Hewynn said the waters of my homeland are connected to me now.","source_cn":"刚刚，伊温小姐说，故乡的水脉从此与我相连。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B8904B97EF7462B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1422672017:0":{"text":"Yet... forgive my ingratitude... when I think of \"home\", I still see Sal'thorin.","source_cn":"但，或许是我不识抬举吧……在提到故乡的时候，我眼前浮现...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD877223502F8275E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1422672018:0":{"text":"I must save it. Change it. That's why I stand here.","source_cn":"我想要去拯救它，改变它。这也是我站在此处的理由。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33F026EE0AB4D280","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1422672019:0":{"text":"So please, Eironn—tell me what the next trial is.","source_cn":"所以，请告诉我下一项考验是什么吧，埃隆。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1946C2EC5FBCD4BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1422672020:0":{"text":"... Stubborn as mountain oak. But the next one won't be easier.","source_cn":"……真是固执。我先警告你，接下来的考验并不会更容易。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5BF68A967D752F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1422672021:0":{"text":"Then all the more reason not to waste time. Let's go.","source_cn":"那就更不能浪费时间了，走吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBC972EEAD3ADC64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:0:1":{"text":"Are you alright?","source_cn":"没事吧？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x001F3B5A66AE48B3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Are you alright?","female":"Are you alright?","variant_male_record_index":"73456","variant_female_record_index":"73457","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1422672005:0":{"text":"It's already getting better. I'll recover soon.","source_cn":"当时是有些疼，但现在已经好多了，很快就可以恢复正常。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE2B4150A2AC4D22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:1:2":{"text":"Does it still hurt?","source_cn":"很疼吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC78B0B0B34595814","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Does it still hurt?","female":"Does it still hurt?","variant_male_record_index":"73458","variant_female_record_index":"73459","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:伊温":{"text":"Hewynn","source":"伊温","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"Indris","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:埃隆":{"text":"Eironn","source":"埃隆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":25,"localized_text_count":24,"speaker_count":3}}